-- src:TA1999-RG6-S185-2003:780 | [AG/LEG/SL/323/2000/1 Vol. 4]
@ref Rg 6 as made, S 185/2003 (the Telecommunications (Dealers) Regulations 2003): the whole text (src:TA1999-RG6-S185-2003:3-780)
GIVEN regulation IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 as made (S 185/2003): the words of the regulation are those of the 2004 Revised Edition` MEANS
    BRANCH IF regulation EQUALS "2" OR regulation EQUALS "4" OR regulation EQUALS "5" OR regulation EQUALS "6" OR regulation EQUALS "7" OR regulation EQUALS "8" OR regulation EQUALS "11" OR regulation EQUALS "12" OR regulation EQUALS "13" OR regulation EQUALS "14" OR regulation EQUALS "15" OR regulation EQUALS "16" OR regulation EQUALS "17" OR regulation EQUALS "18" OR regulation EQUALS "19" OR regulation EQUALS "20" OR regulation EQUALS "21" OR regulation EQUALS "22" OR regulation EQUALS "23" OR regulation EQUALS "24" OR regulation EQUALS "25" OR regulation EQUALS "First Schedule" OR regulation EQUALS "Third Schedule" OR regulation EQUALS "Fourth Schedule" OR regulation EQUALS "Fifth Schedule" THEN JUST TRUE
           IF regulation EQUALS "1" OR regulation EQUALS "3" OR regulation EQUALS "9" OR regulation EQUALS "10" OR regulation EQUALS "26" OR regulation EQUALS "Second Schedule" THEN JUST FALSE
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN regulation IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`Rg 6 as made (S 185/2003): how the words of the regulation differ from the 2004 Revised Edition` MEANS
    BRANCH IF regulation EQUALS "2" OR regulation EQUALS "4" OR regulation EQUALS "5" OR regulation EQUALS "6" OR regulation EQUALS "7" OR regulation EQUALS "8" OR regulation EQUALS "11" OR regulation EQUALS "12" OR regulation EQUALS "13" OR regulation EQUALS "14" OR regulation EQUALS "15" OR regulation EQUALS "16" OR regulation EQUALS "17" OR regulation EQUALS "18" OR regulation EQUALS "19" OR regulation EQUALS "20" OR regulation EQUALS "21" OR regulation EQUALS "22" OR regulation EQUALS "23" OR regulation EQUALS "24" OR regulation EQUALS "25" OR regulation EQUALS "First Schedule" OR regulation EQUALS "Third Schedule" OR regulation EQUALS "Fourth Schedule" OR regulation EQUALS "Fifth Schedule" THEN NOTHING
           IF regulation EQUALS "1" THEN JUST "as made the citation reads '... Regulations 2003 and shall come into operation on 2nd April 2003'; the Revised Edition reads '... Regulations' and prints [2nd April 2003] (TA1999-RG6.txt:66) under the arrangement"
           IF regulation EQUALS "3" THEN JUST "in paragraph (11) the Revised Edition reads 'or possess for sale any type-approved equipment'; as made 'any' is not there, and neither S 48/2004 nor S 593/2004 inserts it"
           IF regulation EQUALS "9" THEN JUST "as made 'renewal fee of $400'; S 48/2004 regulation 2 substitutes '$250', which the Revised Edition prints"
           IF regulation EQUALS "10" THEN JUST "as made paragraph (1)(a) and (b) read '$400'; S 48/2004 regulation 3 substitutes '$250' in each, which the Revised Edition prints"
           IF regulation EQUALS "26" THEN JUST "regulation 26 revokes the Telecommunication (Dealers) Regulations (Rg 7) and is omitted from the Revised Edition"
           IF regulation EQUALS "Second Schedule" THEN JUST "paragraph 5 as made speaks of the ESN, MIN or PIN number of registered and unregistered telecommunication equipment; S 593/2004 regulation 2 substitutes a paragraph about any identification code or number, with a paragraph (2) on SIM cards, which the Revised Edition prints"
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 as made reg 1: the Regulations are in operation on the date (from 2 April 2003)` MEANS d AT LEAST (Date 2 4 2003)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 as made reg 26: the Telecommunication (Dealers) Regulations (Rg 7) are revoked on the date` MEANS d AT LEAST (Date 2 4 2003)

-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:16 | In exercise of the powers conferred by section 74 of the
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:17 | Telecommunications Act, the Info-communications Development
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:18 | Authority of Singapore, with the approval of the Minister for
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:19 | Information, Communications and the Arts, hereby makes the
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:20 | following Regulations:
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:22 | Citation and commencement
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:23 | 1. These Regulations may be cited as the Telecommunications
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:24 | (Dealers) (Amendment) Regulations 2004 and shall come into
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:25 | operation on 3rd February 2004.
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:27 | Amendment of regulation 9
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:28 | 2. Regulation 9 of the Telecommunications (Dealers) Regulations
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:29 | 2003 (G.N. No. S 185/2003) is amended by deleting ‘‘$400’’ and
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:30 | substituting ‘‘$250’’.
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:32 | Amendment of regulation 10
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:33 | 3. Regulation 10 (1) of the Telecommunications (Dealers)
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:34 | Regulations 2003 is amended by deleting ‘‘$400’’ in sub-paragraphs (a)
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:35 | and (b) and substituting in each case ‘‘$250’’.
@ref Rg 6 as amended by S 48/2004: enacting words, citation and commencement, regulations 9 and 10(1) (src:TA1999-RG6-S48-2004:16-35)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 S 48/2004 reg 1: the amendment is in operation on the date (from 3 February 2004)` MEANS d AT LEAST (Date 3 2 2004)

-- Regs 9 and 10(1) fee, for conduct from 2 April 2003 to 31 December 2004 (the Revised Edition, from 1 January 2005, prints $250; later fee changes are in sgta-i-rg6-amendments.l4).
GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`Rg 6 regs 9 and 10(1): the Dealer's Individual Licence renewal fee and annual fee in dollars, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day (2 April 2003 to 31 December 2004)` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`conduct day` LESS THAN (Date 2 4 2003)) OR (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 1 2005)) OR (`reading day` LESS THAN (Date 2 4 2003)) THEN NOTHING
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 3 2 2004)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 3 2 2004)) THEN JUST 250
           OTHERWISE JUST 400

-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:16 | In exercise of the powers conferred by section 74 of the
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:17 | Telecommunications Act, the Info-communications Development
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:18 | Authority of Singapore, with the approval of the Minister for
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:19 | Information, Communications and the Arts, hereby makes the
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:20 | following Regulations:
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:22 | Citation and commencement
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:23 | 1. These Regulations may be cited as the Telecommunications
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:24 | (Dealers) (Amendment No. 2) Regulations 2004 and shall come into
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:25 | operation on 1st October 2004.
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:27 | Amendment of Second Schedule
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:28 | 2. The Second Schedule to the Telecommunications (Dealers)
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:29 | Regulations 2003 (G.N. No. S 185/2003) is amended by deleting
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:30 | paragraph 5 and substituting the following paragraph:
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:31 | ‘‘5.—(1) A Class Licensee shall not have in his possession for sale, hire or
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:32 | use any device or equipment which can be used —
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:33 | (a) to alter, delete or remove any identification code or number of any
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:34 | telecommunication equipment which can be used to obtain any
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:35 | telecommunication services from telecommunication licensees; or
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:36 | (b) to insert or duplicate any identification code or number of such
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:37 | telecommunication equipment in any other telecommunication
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:38 | equipment.
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:39 | (2) For the purposes of this paragraph, telecommunication equipment
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:40 | includes subscriber identification module (‘‘SIM’’) cards.’’.
@ref Rg 6 as amended by S 593/2004: enacting words, citation and commencement, Second Schedule paragraph 5 (src:TA1999-RG6-S593-2004:16-40)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 S 593/2004 reg 1: the amendment is in operation on the date (from 1 October 2004)` MEANS d AT LEAST (Date 1 10 2004)

GIVEN `the Class Licensee has the device or equipment in his possession for sale, or use` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it can be used to alter, delete or remove the ESN, MIN or PIN number of registered telecommunication equipment` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it can be used to insert or duplicate the ESN, MIN or PIN number of registered telecommunication equipment in unregistered telecommunication equipment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 Second Schedule paragraph 5 as made: the Class Licensee contravenes the condition` MEANS
        `the Class Licensee has the device or equipment in his possession for sale, or use`
    AND (   `it can be used to alter, delete or remove the ESN, MIN or PIN number of registered telecommunication equipment`
         OR `it can be used to insert or duplicate the ESN, MIN or PIN number of registered telecommunication equipment in unregistered telecommunication equipment`)

GIVEN `the Class Licensee has the device or equipment in his possession for sale, hire or use` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it can be used to alter, delete or remove any identification code or number of telecommunication equipment which can be used to obtain telecommunication services from telecommunication licensees` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it can be used to insert or duplicate any identification code or number of such telecommunication equipment in any other telecommunication equipment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 Second Schedule paragraph 5 as substituted by S 593/2004: the Class Licensee contravenes the condition` MEANS
        `the Class Licensee has the device or equipment in his possession for sale, hire or use`
    AND (   `it can be used to alter, delete or remove any identification code or number of telecommunication equipment which can be used to obtain telecommunication services from telecommunication licensees`
         OR `it can be used to insert or duplicate any identification code or number of such telecommunication equipment in any other telecommunication equipment`)

GIVEN `the device is a subscriber identification module card` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 Second Schedule paragraph 5(2) as substituted by S 593/2004: the card is "telecommunication equipment" for the paragraph` MEANS `the device is a subscriber identification module card`

GIVEN `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`Rg 6 Second Schedule paragraph 5: the words, for the conduct day, as read on the reading day (2 April 2003 to 31 December 2004)` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (`conduct day` LESS THAN (Date 2 4 2003)) OR (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 1 2005)) OR (`reading day` LESS THAN (Date 2 4 2003)) THEN NOTHING
           IF (`reading day` AT LEAST (Date 27 9 2004)) AND (`conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 10 2004)) THEN JUST "5.-(1) A Class Licensee shall not have in his possession for sale, hire or use any device or equipment which can be used (a) to alter, delete or remove any identification code or number of any telecommunication equipment which can be used to obtain any telecommunication services from telecommunication licensees; or (b) to insert or duplicate any identification code or number of such telecommunication equipment in any other telecommunication equipment. (2) For the purposes of this paragraph, telecommunication equipment includes subscriber identification module (‘‘SIM’’) cards."
           OTHERWISE JUST "5. A Class Licensee shall not have in his possession for sale, or use any device or equipment which can be used to alter, delete or remove the ESN, MIN or PIN number of any registered telecommunication equipment or to insert or duplicate the ESN, MIN or PIN number of any registered telecommunication equipment in any unregistered telecommunication equipment."
